"`io.quarkus.mailer.Mailer` provides the imperative (blocking and "
"synchronous) API;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`io.quarkus.mailer.reactive.ReactiveMailer` provides the reactive (non-"
"blocking and asynchronous) API"
